{"id":5725,"date":"2026-03-27T01:51:56","date_gmt":"2026-03-26T16:21:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?page_id=5725"},"modified":"2026-03-27T15:44:13","modified_gmt":"2026-03-27T06:14:13","slug":"google-shopping-audit-terms","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/free-google-shopping-feed-audit\/google-shopping-audit-terms\/","title":{"rendered":"Google shopping audit terms"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5725\" class=\"elementor elementor-5725\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-506287f elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"506287f\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ed2e22a\" data-id=\"ed2e22a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-238e773 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"238e773\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Terms and Conditions\n<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee04656 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ee04656\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>FeedOps \u2013 Free Google Shopping Feed Audit and Platform Services<\/b><\/p><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:32ddb731-9d4d-413a-a6fc-71ee1bb9d27f-8\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-18\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"6a339d80-a6dd-4896-90d7-7b7f0001e416\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\"><p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"76\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Last updated: <strong>March 26, 2026<\/strong><\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><\/div><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These Terms and Conditions govern the use of the FeedOps platform, including the Free Google Shopping Feed Audit and any related services.<br \/><\/span>By registering for, accessing, or using the FeedOps platform, you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions.<\/p><p>If you do not agree to these Terms, you should not use the service.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5c6656c elementor-section-content-top elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5c6656c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0f87d68\" data-id=\"0f87d68\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f0b75d elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4f0b75d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><b>1. Service Overview<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps provides software and tools designed to analyze, optimize, and manage product data for ecommerce advertising channels and marketplaces.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services may include:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Google Shopping feed audits<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">product data analysis<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">feed optimization tools<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AI-powered product data enrichment<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">feed automation and rule systems<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">channel integrations<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Some services are provided free of charge, while others are paid subscription services.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>2. Free Google Shopping Feed Audit<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Free Google Shopping Feed Audit allows users to analyze product feed data from supported platforms, including Google Merchant Center.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The audit service:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">operates in <\/span><b>read-only mode<\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">does <\/span><b>not modify, publish, or update your product data<\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">does <\/span><b>not make changes to Google Merchant Center, advertising accounts, or ecommerce platforms<\/b><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The audit provides informational insights intended to help users understand potential product data issues affecting visibility or performance.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>3. Marketing Communications<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By registering for the FeedOps platform or the Free Google Shopping Feed Audit, you agree to receive marketing and product-related communications from FeedOps.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These communications may include:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">product updates<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">platform announcements<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">educational content<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">promotional offers<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">invitations to events or webinars<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You may opt out of marketing communications at any time using the unsubscribe link provided in emails.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>4. Account Creation and Verification<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps may review submitted registration details to confirm the legitimacy of users and organizations.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps reserves the right to:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">approve or reject account registrations<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">suspend or remove accounts<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">restrict usage of services<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">if information appears inaccurate, incomplete, fraudulent, or inconsistent with acceptable use of the platform.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>5. Optional Platform Features<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Within the FeedOps platform, users may have the option to connect their product catalog and activate additional platform features.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These features may include:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AI data enrichment<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">automated feed rules<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">product feed optimization<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">publishing feeds to advertising channels or marketplaces<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">data synchronization and transformation tools<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you activate these features:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">the service may become a <\/span><b>paid subscription service<\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>pricing may not be displayed before activation<\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">charges may apply once these services are enabled<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Current platform services involving connected feed optimization may incur fees <\/span><b>starting from no less than $450 per month<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Activation of these features constitutes agreement to applicable service fees.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>6. Billing and Payment Responsibility<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If paid features are activated within the platform, you acknowledge that:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">you may incur recurring subscription fees<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">billing may begin upon activation of optimization or enrichment services<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">fees may be invoiced monthly in advance or arrears depending on the service arrangement<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you do not wish to incur charges, you should not activate paid features within the platform.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Failure to pay applicable fees may result in suspension or termination of services.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>7. Responsibility for Data Changes<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you connect your product catalog and enable optimization or automation features, FeedOps systems may apply transformations to your product data based on rules, AI models, or configuration settings.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You acknowledge that:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">you are responsible for reviewing and approving data changes before publishing<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps is not responsible for unintended outcomes caused by automated transformations or user configurations<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Use of feed optimization features is at your own risk.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>8. Feedback and Suggestions<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps may invite users to provide feedback regarding the audit service or platform features.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Users are not obligated to provide feedback.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps is not obligated to implement suggestions or recommendations submitted by users.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Feedback may be used by FeedOps to improve products, services, and platform functionality.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>9. Acceptable Use<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Users agree not to:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">misuse the platform or services<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">attempt to disrupt platform operations<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">run automated scripts that overload the service<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">reverse engineer software or algorithms<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">use the platform for unlawful purposes<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps reserves the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate acceptable use policies.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>10. Data Access and Permissions<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When connecting external services such as Google Merchant Center, ecommerce platforms, or data feeds, users grant FeedOps permission to access relevant data required to operate the platform.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps will:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">only access data required for the requested service<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">use secure authentication mechanisms<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">allow users to revoke access at any time through their connected services<\/span><\/li><\/ul><h3><b>11. Service Availability<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps aims to provide reliable access to the platform and services.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">However, services are provided <\/span><b>on an &#8220;as is&#8221; and &#8220;as available&#8221; basis<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps does not guarantee uninterrupted service and may suspend or modify services for maintenance, upgrades, or security purposes.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>12. Limitation of Liability<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps is not liable for:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">advertising performance outcomes<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">data inaccuracies originating from third-party systems<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">business losses resulting from feed configuration or advertising decisions<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">indirect, incidental, or consequential damages<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The platform provides tools and insights but does not guarantee performance results.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>13. Intellectual Property<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All FeedOps software, systems, methodologies, and audit technologies remain the intellectual property of FeedOps.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Users may not reproduce, distribute, copy, or reverse engineer FeedOps technology without prior written permission.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>14. Account Suspension or Termination<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps reserves the right to suspend or terminate accounts that:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">violate these Terms<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">misuse free services<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">abuse platform resources<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">fail to pay applicable fees<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Users may terminate their account at any time by contacting FeedOps.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>15. Changes to Terms and Conditions<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps reserves the right to modify or update these Terms and Conditions at any time.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Updated Terms will be published on the FeedOps website or platform.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Continued use of the service after updates are published constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>16. Governing Law<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These Terms and Conditions are governed by the laws of the jurisdiction in which FeedOps operates, unless otherwise required by applicable law.<\/span><\/p><h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>17. Contact Information<\/b><\/span><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For questions regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact:<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><a href=\"mailto:sales@feedops.com\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">sales@feedops.com<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/www.feedops.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">www.feedops.com<\/span><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35ae378 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"35ae378\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e671941 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"e671941\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<style>\n.elementor-nav-menu {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center; \n  justify-content: space-between !important;\n  width: 71%;\n}\n.elementor-nav-menu:after {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n.elementor-sticky--active{\n    display: none;;\n}\n<\/style>\n<script>\nwindow.addEventListener('load', () => {\n  const menus = document.querySelectorAll('.elementor-nav-menu');\n\n  menus.forEach(navMenu => {\n    \/\/ Clear existing items\n    navMenu.innerHTML = '';\n\n    \/\/ FAQ item\n    const faqItem = document.createElement('li');\n    faqItem.className = 'menu-item';\n    faqItem.innerHTML = `<a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/free-google-shopping-feed-audit\/#faq\" class=\"elementor-item\">FAQ<\/a>`;\n\n    \/\/ Button item\n    const buttonItem = document.createElement('li');\n    buttonItem.className = 'menu-item';\n    buttonItem.innerHTML = `\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/free-google-shopping-feed-audit\/#request-access\" class=\"elementor-item\" style=\"\n        background:#FFC107;\n        padding:10px 20px;\n        border-radius:6px;\n        color:#000;\n        font-weight:600;\n        margin-left:10px;\n        display:inline-block;\n      \">\n        Get Free Access\n      <\/a>\n    `;\n\n    \/\/ Append both\n    navMenu.appendChild(faqItem);\n    navMenu.appendChild(buttonItem);\n  });\n});\n<\/script>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Terms and Conditions FeedOps \u2013 Free Google Shopping Feed Audit and Platform Services Last updated: March 26, 2026 These Terms and Conditions govern the use of the FeedOps platform, including the Free Google Shopping Feed Audit and any related services.By registering for, accessing, or using the FeedOps platform, you agree to be bound by these [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11,"featured_media":0,"parent":5708,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5725","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium pl